{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_08_beg","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_08","title":"影與灰","storyCode":"GA-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5b64de7ba2cb22852a8ea8e1c0e0ee1594dfa9082c9393af78cf6375fb139753","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，自掏腰包吧，這裡的維修費用很貴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午茶的甜點往後只能減半了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下！我聽到大教堂方向傳來戰鬥聲，您沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......？！是異端襲擊了您嗎？......這是我的失職！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼緊張，保拉里奧，還記得上次大教堂掰腕比賽的冠軍是誰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是稍微活動了一下手腕，不小心搞出了一點小意外而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城內的騷亂已經平息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他們撤退了。我都還沒來得及炸爽——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請問可以進來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，抱歉，教宗閣下，我失態了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，您要找的人已經到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進吧，孩子們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下，向您致敬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下，您好，我是塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，歡迎，這裡有點亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝茶一般配什麼甜點？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......需要我做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，讓我想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往自己的茶杯裡加塊方糖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾，你得多加幾塊，糖分能舒緩緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！好、好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下，如果我......想要離開拉特蘭，您會同意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不允許，你會服從嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個可憐的老頭子，最大的願望就是窩在軟乎乎的搖椅裡安度晚年，哪有功夫去管小女孩的旅行計畫呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可塞茜莉亞是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？難不成她還能是天使和魔鬼的混血，讓啟示降臨的聖徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞只是個想要出門看看的小姑娘，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還帶著你媽媽的守護銃，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對不起！我是不是應該交給艾澤爾哥哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獲得守護銃是一件莊嚴的事，原本得舉行隆重的儀式，需要監護人出席，導師的首肯，還有一大堆麻煩的文書工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你也沒到可以獲得守護銃的年紀。所以，悄悄地把它帶走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢說這是給你的禮物。每一把銃都是拉特蘭的寶貴財富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，若只是孩子思念母親的寄託，我相信不會有人阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶上它吧，孩子。你的身體狀況可能不允許你扣下扳機，幹掉什麼壞蛋......但它能提醒你，不管走到哪裡，你都是從拉特蘭出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，謝謝您，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾，陪著她一起吧，算你的長期外勤任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得偶爾回來看看就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......真的有這個資格嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然有。你做出了選擇，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會竭盡全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓塞茜莉亞被欺負了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，去吧，時光可不等人。到了我這個年紀，就只會滿腦子想著睡午覺啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會一直走下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我將為你祝禱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下，這就足夠了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他們一起吃了點心，這就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......按照您的指示，那個男人已經離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是應該多留他一會兒？也許吃塊巧克力能讓他打起點精神？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗閣下，您太心軟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，薇爾麗芙，我們註定無法成為寒夜中的炬火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，為抱薪者端上一杯熱茶......總還是做得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“這片大地難以容忍美善”......願那些不承認這一點的人能夠成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也該做下一件事了。騷亂已經平息，召集各國使節吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啟示既昭，我將行我須行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼想，菲亞梅塔，你不用承擔任何東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這是我的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管他那時正覬覦什麼力量，想探究什麼秘密，要得到什麼答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管他的崇高理想，偉大事業，救贖了誰又引導了誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不為信仰，不為拉特蘭城，不為戍衛隊，甚至不為逝去的時光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不原諒，只因為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，你辜負了信任你的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼你還能安然無恙地出現在這裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼連教宗閣下都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......又有什麼為什麼......路從一開始就不存在，又能在虛無中尋得什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的懺悔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懺悔？不，我沒有懺悔......何方可供我懺悔？沒有光亮，沒有前途，受難者必將受難，悲哀者只有悲哀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有得救，沒有樂園，這裡是拉特蘭，這裡只屬於我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果光芒本就是虛影......不，不是虛影......是實在......不如我們所願......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從未有過光芒......又何談照亮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼，安多恩？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我放棄了嗎，我為什麼在這裡，我放棄了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這障壁如此之厚，我怎麼能夠擁抱他們？我怎麼可以擁抱他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我只是個兜售虛假希望的騙子......騙到自己也信了這說辭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，我不明白。它的判斷是什麼？它想讓我去向何方？它的存在本身明明已經堵死了我的道路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向何處尋覓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩！給我清醒一點！看清楚站在你面前的人是誰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰......啊......菲亞梅塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在發什麼瘋？！你那副振振有詞、理直氣壯的樣子呢？你的骨頭被抽走了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓我對一個癡人瘋漢興師問罪！看清楚你現在在哪裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在拉特蘭，菲亞梅塔。我在大教堂之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高興與你們重逢......不，我現在一點也不高興。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是還會抵擋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有臉抵擋？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說對不起。安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，跪下來，對莫斯提馬，還有蕾繆安的方向，說“對不起”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是覺得自己沒有錯嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的錯誤不可勝數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你*拉特蘭俚語*還挺得意是不是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，安多恩，你有什麼信念，我不關心，你的信念全完蛋，我也不在意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安原諒你，莫斯提馬原諒你，伊萬傑利斯塔十一世原諒你，就算整個拉特蘭都原諒你——我也絕不原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我很抱歉，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你該道歉的人不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......當年的事，若再來一次......也許我仍會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不是吧，認真的？你非要在菲亞梅塔面前這麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且你現在不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好。安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿出你的銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，這不會有結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我*拉特蘭俚語*是為了結果？！你以為我在這裡把你殺了，蕾繆安的八年就能回來嗎？！莫斯提馬的人生就能復原嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*拉特蘭俚語*結果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要找你算帳，是因為我*拉特蘭俚語*就是要找你算帳！懂了嗎？安多恩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這是你的執念嗎，菲亞梅塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我再說一遍，安多恩——拿出你的銃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
